flowchart LR
  accTitle: Harness Bridge isolation and authority boundary
  accDescr: The host and OpenShell supervision are trusted. Existing DSH runs in a fresh Docker workload. Network calls pass through OpenShell policy. Optional business APIs remain host-owned and must enforce their own data authorization.

  subgraph host["Trusted host application"]
    App["Authenticated app<br/>Identity · current permissions"]
    Bridge["Harness Bridge"]
    API["Optional business API<br/>Row · field · resource checks"]
    App --> Bridge
  end

  subgraph trusted["Trusted OpenShell components"]
    Control["Native control plane<br/>Lifecycle · policy · providers"]
    Supervisor["Trusted supervisor<br/>Policy-approved egress"]
  end

  subgraph task["Untrusted workload · fresh Docker sandbox"]
    DSH["Existing DSH + tools<br/>Task code · workspace"]
  end

  Bridge -->|fixed native CLI| Control
  Control -->|create / upload / exec| DSH
  DSH -->|network requests| Supervisor
  Supervisor -->|approved model access| Provider["External model provider"]
  Supervisor -.->|if explicitly configured| API

  classDef host fill:#f5f7fa,stroke:#8a9aa8,color:#263e4e,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef bridge fill:#173d50,stroke:#173d50,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px
  classDef native fill:#eaf4f0,stroke:#5d9385,color:#234d43,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef workload fill:#fff4e9,stroke:#c2935f,color:#664625,stroke-width:1.5px
  class App,API host
  class Bridge bridge
  class Control,Supervisor,Provider native
  class DSH workload
  style host fill:#fbfcfe,stroke:#b0bdc8,stroke-width:1px
  style trusted fill:#f7fbf9,stroke:#a3c1b7,stroke-width:1px
  style task fill:#fffaf5,stroke:#cda673,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
